{"id": "mm5337a2", "status": "invalid", "message_id": "msg_011CggGVixPkyCfDtS2hQP2U", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "errors": ["quote over 25 words: approximately 75,766 AADs and 2.3 million YPLLs, or approxim…", "quote not found in the article: YPLLs are then calculated by multiplying age- and sex-specif…"], "usage": {"input": 8470, "output": 3335}, "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "{\"id\": \"mm5337a2\",\n \"data_focus\": {\"v\": \"yes\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"summary\", \"q\": \"approximately 75,766 AADs and 2.3 million YPLLs, or approximately 30 years of life lost on average per AAD, were attributable to excessive alcohol use in 2001\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Of the 75,766 deaths, 34,833 (46%) resulted from chronic conditions, and 40,933 (54%) resulted from acute conditions.\"}]},\n \"outcome_types\": [{\"v\": \"count/rate\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Of the estimated 2,279,322 YPLLs, 788,005 (35%) resulted from chronic conditions\"}]}, {\"v\": \"binary/categorical\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Overall, 54,847 (72%) of all AADs involved males, and 4,554 (6%) involved persons aged <21 years.\"}]}],\n \"analytic_depth\": [{\"v\": \"summary\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"summary\", \"q\": \"approximately 75,766 AADs and 2.3 million YPLLs\"}]}, {\"v\": \"comparison\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Of the 75,766 deaths, 34,833 (46%) resulted from chronic conditions, and 40,933 (54%) resulted from acute conditions.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The 2.3 million YPLLs for excessive drinking is approximately half of the total YPLLs that were caused by smoking in 1999\"}]}],\n \"study_design\": [{\"v\": \"surveillance/descriptive\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Alcohol-Related Disease Impact (ARDI)* software was used to estimate the number of AADs and YPLLs.\"}]}],\n \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"ARDI estimates AADs by multiplying the number of deaths from a particular alcohol-related condition by its alcohol-attributable fraction (AAF).\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"YPLLs are then calculated by multiplying age- and sex-specific AAD estimates by the corresponding estimate of life expectancy.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the system calculates AAFs by using relative risk estimates from meta-analyses\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"AAFs for motor-vehicle--traffic deaths are obtained from the Fatality Analysis Reporting System\"}],\n \"confidence\": \"medium\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}